This software utilizes the framework for modeling 2D SRAM and 2D NVM from NVSim.
Also, the coarse- and fine-grained TSV (through silicon via) models are utilized from CACTI-3DD. 
Technology models in Bulk Planar CMOS technologies and eNVM technologies from DESTINY

