The binary current-sense-amplifier adaptation in src/BinarySenseAmp.cpp uses
NeuroSim's updated MultilevelSenseAmp equations from revision
9825ef40bf14d12a72c99d8e32ff8c499aeddf24 (neurosim/NeuroSim).
Those equations are distributed under CC BY-NC 4.0; their original copyright,
redistribution conditions, and disclaimer are retained in that source file.
The source comments describe the binary reference, accounting boundary, and
standby-leakage assumptions. This adaptation is experimental;
source-fit parity does not establish circuit or silicon accuracy.
